      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "vector<int>dp(n,1)\n\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++) :\n\n    for(int j = i-1; j >=0 ; j--):\n\n        if(arr[j] < arr[i]):\n\n            dp[i] = max(dp[i]  ,1 + dp[j] )\n\ncout << *max_element(dp.begin(),dp.end())",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vector<int>dp(n,1)\n\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++) :\n\n    for(int j = i-1; j >=0 ; j--):\n\n        if(arr[j] < arr[i]):\n\n            dp[i] = max(dp[i]  ,1 + dp[j] )\n\ncout << *max_element(dp.begin(),dp.end())",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
